{"2854800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alex & Arty", "steam_appid": 2854800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world falling apart because of a ruthless corporation, an explorer and a magical being meet by chance… or by destiny. What begins as a routine mission soon becomes a fight for survival, identity, and the rebirth of a wounded planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring the World Back to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollution has consumed the planet. Use Alex's Ionizer, journey alongside Arty, and restore each biome as color and wildlife return to the world. Purify the corruption spreading across the land and watch a once-lifeless environment flourish once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Together with Arty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arty is more than a companion — he's the key to your journey. His mystical powers allow him to transform into different forms, unlocking new ways to travel, overcome environmental challenges, and reach previously inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Reshape the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't just clean the world — you'll reshape it. Design and build your own settlements, restore structures left to decay, and reactivate forgotten technologies as you forge a brighter future from the ruins of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Real Planet Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the cause of such widespread pollution and restore planet Earth at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/4135f52cccf6562a79456b6b2bb75abc.avif?t=1787264349\" width=789 height=412 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world falling apart because of a ruthless corporation, an explorer and a magical being meet by chance… or by destiny. What begins as a routine mission soon becomes a fight for survival, identity, and the rebirth of a wounded planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring the World Back to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollution has consumed the planet. Use Alex's Ionizer, journey alongside Arty, and restore each biome as color and wildlife return to the world. Purify the corruption spreading across the land and watch a once-lifeless environment flourish once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Together with Arty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arty is more than a companion — he's the key to your journey. His mystical powers allow him to transform into different forms, unlocking new ways to travel, overcome environmental challenges, and reach previously inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Reshape the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't just clean the world — you'll reshape it. Design and build your own settlements, restore structures left to decay, and reactivate forgotten technologies as you forge a brighter future from the ruins of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.poster.avif?t=1787264349\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.webm?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.mp4?t=1787264349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Real Planet Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the cause of such widespread pollution and restore planet Earth at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/4135f52cccf6562a79456b6b2bb75abc.avif?t=1787264349\" width=789 height=412 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Restore a dying alien world through the bond between Alex and Arty. Use Alex’s tech to cleanse corruption, help Arty bring light back to each region, and watch the planet transform through your actions.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Catalan, Portuguese - Brazil, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/8ffb8922cd2cf84fdae139bdceea53d01d105850/header.jpg?t=1787264349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/0e91b19aeae042a1e356f59da26b68d736cd6519/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787264349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/0e91b19aeae042a1e356f59da26b68d736